{"id": "EUVD-2026-102526", "enisaUuid": "4b9e7ccf-822d-3061-a038-99f6e14a8d3f", "description": "libmodplug through 0.8.9.1 contains a heap-based out-of-bounds read vulnerability in CSoundFile::ReadAMS2() in src/load_ams.cpp that allows attackers to read adjacent heap memory via crafted AMS files. Attackers can supply an AMS module whose pattern effect bytes keep bit 7 set, driving the decoder past the input buffer and crashing any libmodplug consumer.", "datePublished": "2026-10-15T21:43:18", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T14:39:25", "baseScore": 6.8, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@haind-pwn/libmodplug-dsm-pattern-oob-write", "https://github.com/Konstanty/libmodplug/blob/d1b97ed0020bc620a059d3675d1854b40bd2608d/src/load_ams.cpp#L509-L537", "https://github.com/Konstanty/libmodplug", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/libmodplug-through-0.8.9.1-heap-out-of-bounds-read-via-csoundfile-readams2"], "aliases": ["GHSA-pxwm-j3xc-rxqw", "CVE-2026-111271"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.13, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0217aa59-6d7e-3f30-bf8e-96018bac645f", "product": {"name": "libmodplug", "vendor": {"name": "Konstanty Bialkowski"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22640.8.9.1"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "c1016f83-3f51-334b-b2ad-c3f28b2b9f79", "vendor": {"name": "Konstanty Bialkowski"}}], "isExploited": false}